  short="Cholangiocarcinoma is a cancer of the bile ducts, inside or outside the liver. It often shows up as painless, deepening jaundice with itching, pale stools and weight loss. Tests such as MRCP, CT and EUS find it, and a sample taken during EUS or ERCP confirms it. Surgery can cure early cases; stents relieve jaundice in others.",
