   ("Treatment", ["- Stones in the bile duct are removed by ERCP","- Bile leaks are treated with an ERCP stent, which lets the leak heal","- Loose motions often improve with smaller, lower-fat meals; medicines that bind bile help some people","- Acidity and IBS are treated in the usual way"]),
